{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "细数老对手的陈年旧账  (Recounting Xie Ling's Old Tricks)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Out in Xingtian's open workspace, a furious Xingzi and Kaiwen fill Bu Xiaogu in on Xie Ling's long history of underhanded schemes against Chun Yuqiao. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "怎么会是谢灵呢？就算老大不回来，也得找个靠谱的人吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "早在艾米的时候，他就一直把老大当成假想敌，处处为难老大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "工作上斗不过老大，就在人事上动手脚使绊子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "最后他还利用老大和骆琳的感情大做文章，搞得公司乌烟瘴气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大来了星天这几年，他使尽一切办法，还是没有赢过老大一局。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "去年他还往咱们这儿塞眼线，花钱来截胡咱们艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "当年跟咱们抢尹正宇，那事就是他干的呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不是他是谁啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "为了算计老大，不光彩的事他全都干尽了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这位可倒好，直接跑来这儿摘老大种的熟苹果！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他到底要不要脸啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看他那得意的样，咱们怎么能咽下这口气呢？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "怎么会是谢灵呢？就算老大不回来，也得找个靠谱的人吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How could it be Xie Ling? Even if the boss did not return, they should have hired someone reliable!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "早在艾米的时候，他就一直把老大当成假想敌，处处为难老大。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Back at ME, he always treated the boss as an imaginary enemy and made life hard for him everywhere.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "工作上斗不过老大，就在人事上动手脚使绊子。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unable to beat the boss professionally, he played dirty tricks in office politics instead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "最后他还利用老大和骆琳的感情大做文章，搞得公司乌烟瘴气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In the end he even exploited the boss's breakup with Luo Lin, turning the company toxic.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大来了星天这几年，他使尽一切办法，还是没有赢过老大一局。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In the years since the boss joined Xingtian, he tried every trick yet never won a single round.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "去年他还往咱们这儿塞眼线，花钱来截胡咱们艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last year he even planted informants here and spent money to poach our artists.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "当年跟咱们抢尹正宇，那事就是他干的呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When someone tried to snatch Yin Zhengyu away from us back then, was that his doing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不是他是谁啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who else could it possibly have been!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "为了算计老大，不光彩的事他全都干尽了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'To undermine the boss, there was no underhanded stunt he would not pull.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这位可倒好，直接跑来这儿摘老大种的熟苹果！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And now look at him, marching straight in here to pick the ripe apples the boss planted!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他到底要不要脸啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Has the man got no shame at all?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看他那得意的样，咱们怎么能咽下这口气呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just look how smug he is—how could we ever swallow this insult?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "怎么会是谢灵呢？就算老大不回来，也得找个靠谱的人吧！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "早在艾米的时候，他就一直把老大当成假想敌，处处为难老大。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "工作上斗不过老大，就在人事上动手脚使绊子。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "最后他还利用老大和骆琳的感情大做文章，搞得公司乌烟瘴气。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大来了星天这几年，他使尽一切办法，还是没有赢过老大一局。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "去年他还往咱们这儿塞眼线，花钱来截胡咱们艺人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "当年跟咱们抢尹正宇，那事就是他干的呀？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "不是他是谁啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "为了算计老大，不光彩的事他全都干尽了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这位可倒好，直接跑来这儿摘老大种的熟苹果！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他到底要不要脸啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你看他那得意的样，咱们怎么能咽下这口气呢？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outraged that a longtime rival has waltzed in to harvest the orchard Chun Yuqiao planted, Xingzi and Kaiwen vow never to swallow this humiliation quietly. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
